mple FIFO and register behavior. Heart rate and SpO2 are guest algorithms, not direct host-faked sensor registers.", "registers": [{"interrupt_status": "0x00", "interrupt_enable": "0x01", "fifo_write": "0x02", "fifo_overflow": "0x03", "fifo_read": "0x04", "fifo_data": "0x05", "mode": "0x06", "spo2_config": "0x07", "led_config": "0x09", "temperature": "0x16/0x17", "revision": "0xFE", "part_id": "0xFF", "fifo_encoding": "read FIFO 0x05, four bytes IR_MSB,IR_LSB,RED_MSB,RED_LSB as confirmed by max30100_read_fifo()"}], "gaps": ["FIFO timing, overflow, read-pointer and interrupt behavior still need execution coverage; raw sample byte format has been confirmed in max30100.c.", "Raw optical fixtures do not establish biological, clinical or physical optical accuracy."]}, "inputs": {"ir-sample": {"type": "integer", "label": "红外样本", "default": 0, "default_source": "synthetic-test-fixture", "unit": "raw16", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 65535, "readOnly": false}, "red-sample": {"type": "integer", "label": "红光样本", "default": 0, "default_source": "synthetic-test-fixture", "unit": "raw16", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 65535, "readOnly": false}}, "outputs": {}, "evidence": [{"kind": "official-product", "url": "https://docs.m5stack.com/en/unit/heart", "checked_at": "2026-10-26", "claims": ["SKU and chip identity", "PinMap wire colors", "documented electrical and functional limits"]}, {"kind": "official-driver", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/m5stack/uiflow-micropython/master/m5stack/libs/unit/heart.py", "checked_at": "2026-10-26", "claims": ["guest driver transaction path and encoding"], "sha256": "15249bf0e931f5d33dae61ac5a7899a2862faa4e86698249f909228e8272dbbe"}, {"kind": "official-linked-datasheet-or-schematic", "url": "https://m5stack.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/resource/docs/datasheet/unit/MAX30100.pdf", "checked_at": "2026-10-26", "retrieval_status": "linked-by-verified-product-page", "claims": ["reference for implementation; linked document content is not claimed to have 